{"title":"Body","body":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"version":{"type":"string","example":"v8","description":"MongoDB version (supported: v6, v7, v8)"},"replicas":{"type":"integer","format":"int64","description":"Number of replicas.\n1 = standalone mode (storage-level replication)\n2-8 = cluster mode (application-level replication)\nMode cannot be changed after creation.","maximum":8,"minimum":1},"size":{"type":"integer","format":"int64","description":"Storage capacity in GB","maximum":4096,"minimum":1},"external":{"type":"boolean","description":"Enable external access via LoadBalancer"},"sharding":{"description":"Sharding configuration. When enabled, deploys config servers, mongos routers, and shards.","type":"object","properties":{"enabled":{"type":"boolean","description":"Enable sharding"},"config":{"description":"Sharding configuration (required when enabled is true)","type":"object","properties":{"configServers":{"description":"Config server configuration","type":"object","properties":{"replicas":{"type":"integer","format":"int64","description":"Number of config server replicas","maximum":7,"minimum":1},"size":{"type":"integer","format":"int64","description":"Storage capacity in GB for config servers","maximum":4096,"minimum":1}}},"mongos":{"description":"Mongos router configuration","type":"object","properties":{"replicas":{"type":"integer","format":"int64","description":"Number of mongos replicas","maximum":8,"minimum":1}}},"shards":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":"string","description":"Shard name"},"replicas":{"type":"integer","format":"int64","description":"Number of replicas for this shard","maximum":8,"minimum":1},"size":{"type":"integer","format":"int64","description":"Storage capacity in GB for this shard","maximum":4096,"minimum":1}}},"description":"List of shard configurations"}}}}}}}}},"required":true}}